onté avec son copain d’enfance est sabordé par le groupe, il n’a plus qu’une idée en tête : se venger. Il se débrouille alors pour être embauché dans l’usine familiale et convainc ses collègues de dérober une partie du stock. Avec toujours le même objectif : faire tomber la plus puissante dynastie de la ville."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yVm8EgrCV0fZTR2T6S0mGgqKIUz.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zgsxJpxiVaGpUFXKr6zujPWQvou.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1140056,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yVm8EgrCV0fZTR2T6S0mGgqKIUz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yVm8EgrCV0fZTR2T6S0mGgqKIUz.jpg","language":"it","width":510,"height":764},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yVm8EgrCV0fZTR2T6S0mGgqKIUz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yVm8EgrCV0fZTR2T6S0mGgqKIUz.jpg","language":"it","width":510,"height":764}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yBnY6elyOlEk6bKfxEoaHFaqwai.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yBnY6elyOlEk6bKfxEoaHFaqwai.jpg","language":"en","width":1175,"height":1763},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yBnY6elyOlEk6bKfxEoaHFaqwai.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yBnY6elyOlEk6bKfxEoaHFaqwai.jpg","language":"en","width":1175,"height":1763},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kRQktZK1ZUUeWnFY8O04uA5cRbd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kRQktZK1ZUUeWnFY8O04uA5cRbd.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750}]},"fr":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iIVTJE7Ldq3uVgYNL3QP5zUXmp8.jpg